        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-74477\"><b>Laurey 74477, Aventura Cabinet Knob in Venetian Bronze</b></a>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Aventura Venetian Bronze Knob has rounded edges, giving it a transitional feel. This Venetian Bronze cabinet pull can used on any light weight door or drawer. This kitchen cabinet hardware is easy to care for. The Aventura Cabinet Knob in Venetian Bronze comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Aventura\">Laurey Aventura Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey 74477 Aventura Venetian Bronze Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Venetian Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 finishes:</b>\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-74477\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74477-SM.jpg?v=1704354552\" width=\"115\" height=\"77\" alt=\"LAU-74477\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/aventura-oil-rubbed-bronze-knob-laurey-74466\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74466-SM.jpg?v=1704354551\" width=\"115\" height=\"77\" alt=\"LAU-74466\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/aventura-polished-chrome-knob-laurey-74426\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74426-SM.jpg?v=1704354551\" width=\"115\" height=\"77\" alt=\"LAU-74426\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/aventura-satin-nickel-knob-laurey-74428\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74428-SM.jpg?v=1704354551\" width=\"115\" height=\"77\" alt=\"LAU-74428\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/aventura-champagne-bra